Z||000000||85ZainoGT||11-13-2001||11:06 AM||||my 87gt has 136k on the engine, just wondering what really happens when you get it tuned up, how much it costs? all taht fun stuff, anything I should be aware of... who is good who isnt... thanks for the help!<P>------------------<BR>Paul Ventimiglia<BR>1987 Gold GT 2.8L<BR>All the options :)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SigPic2222.jpg"> <BR>NEW pics are coming SOON hopefully... geez!||||reg||14
Z||000001||PBJ||11-13-2001||01:00 PM||||A tune up would be <P>spark plugs<BR>dist cap<BR>dist rotor<BR>fuel filter<BR>pcv<BR>air filter<BR>clean throtle body and IAC bore/pintle<P>major would add spark plug wires. and injector flush.<P>CAUTION. is if the spark plugs have not been out in a while the frt ones tend to sieze in.<P>Hope this helps<P>Pete||||reg||1
Z||000002||avengador1||11-13-2001||06:45 PM||||Don't forget to use high temp anti-seize lubricant on the spark plug threads. This will help ensure that they come out the next time you have to change them.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
